Read the whole manual and work the relevant complete labs for observation, identification, maps, time, tectonics, and Earth processes as the study develops. Record the actual downloaded revision rather than inferring it from the original publication year. The publisher supplies instructor material separately; it is not assumed to be included in the public student text.

